{"id":"n65940-1-12","stage":5,"title":"실적 · 实绩","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65940-1-12-1","ko":"이번 달에는 왜 보너스를 못 받았어요?","zh":"这个月为什么没有拿到奖金呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"달에는","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달에는","audio":"/audio/dd730b45290e7d0d9b2a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"보너스를","meaning":"奖金","explanation":"보너스：奖金；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"보너스","audio":"/audio/1e6c6086110c570346c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14490","senseId":"1","lemma":"보너스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보너스를","audio":"/audio/bf621fa62af2ee3cf788.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"받았어요?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았어요","audio":"/audio/abfe820f38fb1595fe88.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"1e6c6086110c5703","term":"보너스","zh":"奖金","audio":"/audio/1e6c6086110c570346c7.mp3","entryId":"14490","definition":"定期工资以外按照业绩或贡献度而额外获得的奖励的钱。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac65a41389fa69480f9c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65940-1-12-2","ko":"지난 달에 비해 영업 실적이 많이 떨어져서요.","zh":"因为和上个月相比，销售业绩下降了很多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달에","audio":"/audio/0f8e45b47a9b54bf0acc.mp3"}},{"text":"비해","meaning":"比起","explanati